# parking.finenumbers.com is read-only

On `parking.finenumbers.com`, any change is forbidden. Only read operations are allowed.

Never write, edit, delete, truncate, chmod, chown, install, restart, or reconfigure anything on that host. This includes FreeRADIUS config, sudoers, scripts, packages, logrotate, services, and the log file itself.

Do not upload files (scp, sftp put, rsync to the server). Do not run a shell that can write. Do not send a command whose arguments come from the UI.

Reading `/var/log/freeradius/calls.log` is allowed, including `stat` of that file for size and inode and `dd` of a byte range. `sudo -n` may wrap only those two reads, because the file is mode `0600` and owned by `freerad`. No other remote command is allowed.
